{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hhhEt1qDaG1791539657.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p style=\"text-align: left\">墨西哥發生監獄騷亂，最少10死16傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MEX.RIOT-1600.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mExRykxn9u1791533785.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.MEX.RIOT-1600.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">騷亂發生後，有軍方和國民警衛隊等到場維持秩序。事發在墨西哥西北部錫那羅亞州一個監獄，當地周四早上發生騷亂，造成9名囚犯和1名來探視的家屬死亡，另有16名囚犯受傷，已送醫治理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MEX.RIOT-1600_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026jYDljW4Jer1791533797.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.MEX.RIOT-1600_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">美聯社引述當地傳媒報道，有囚犯在衝突中使用槍支，當局未透露騷亂具體原因。該監獄有一千八百名囚犯，當局指局勢已得到控制，將調查事件並確定相關責任。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T10:18:33.155087+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}